  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6Dn7NvW.png\" alt=\"标题\"></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&label=Discord&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=MarsThePlanet&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lava-turns-sand-into-glass-fabric-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/883465?color=F16436&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label=Curseforge&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flava-turns-sand-into-glass\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/lava-turns-sand-into-glass?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=modrinth&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>这款可配置的模组会让沙子方块在接触熔岩时瞬间转化为玻璃。非常适合创建玻璃农场，或为你的游戏体验增添一丝趣味。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DXY3iwp.png\" width=\"524\"></p>\n<p><strong>配置：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>你可以直接在游戏内配置此模组，或编辑配置文件夹中的 JSON 文件 <code>config/lavasand.json</code>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>blocks_to_glass</strong> - 熔岩会转化为玻璃的方块列表</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\"></a></p>",
